    "@value": "crack-nymex-3-2-1"
   }
  ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel": [
   {
    "@language": "en",
    "@value": "NYMEX 3:2:1 crack spread"
   }
  ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote": [
   {
    "@language": "en",
    "@value": "Shares the name 3-2-1 with MPC's regional crack spreads but is a different series: its legs are exchange futures, and its gasoline leg is RBOB, which MPC's benchmarks do not use. MPC Economics publishes it as NYMEX 3-2-1 Crack (Price Master 39998) and calls the diesel leg NYMEX Heating Oil (crack-spread-kpi-definition.md, section 4.3)."
   }
  ],
